{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As part of this <u>free demo</u>, you get access to the first 20 minutes of gameplay to appreciate the format and storyline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544690/extras/ezgif-36be0a4cbb3581.gif?t=1740793632\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cQuiet Dan Demo\u201d</strong> is a <u>demo</u> of a provocative novel in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u0422\u0418\u0425\u0418\u0419 \u0414\u042d\u041d","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544690/84eed03bace38d41b7d67477c3523e034eb91afc.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544690?t=1740793632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544690?t=1740793632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544690/6590bbf1c42354b3772537d8bbc8b77cf2cb1741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740793632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544690/6590bbf1c42354b3772537d8bbc8b77cf2cb1741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740793632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As par